-- BP26-CATALOGUE-1 (2026-10-26, charter pillars core, research, reach, security, autonomy, cost). Owner directive 2026-10-26, verbatim: "Implement general best practices
-- systemwide across the fleet" and "Implement and deploy all. All documented findings shall be programmed into portfolio/program/project roadmap/issues/tasks".
-- Source: research report wf-232b4527-680f-8492-8dc9-5ab6ae365e14 (2026-10-26): a best-practice catalogue in four sections (editorial and research quality for
-- AI-generated publishing; Cloudflare Workers engineering; operating autonomous agent fleets; EU/Dutch privacy and AI Act compliance), 30 practices and 56 metrics.
-- This file programmes every finding into the portfolio: five projects under the existing programs (QNFO.RSCH, QNFO.OPS, QNFO.REACH, QNFO.INFRA), one goal
-- (BP26-CATALOGUE) whose definition of done is zero open BP26 issues, one agent_issues row per practice (predicate BP26-<KEY>) mapped to its project and placed on the
-- roadmap, every metric registered with its trigger (METRIC-CLOSED-LOOP-1), a per-issue closing probe on its metrics, two headline metrics computed on fleet_tick_heavy
-- (bp26_metrics_unmeasured, bp26_issues_open), the three owner-only steps as IDENTITY-BOUND cards with their defaults, and the decisions in decision_log.
-- Already shipped by the same session on 2026-10-26: PR 4394 (q08-signal-engine 0.37.0 AI label + secure headers), PR 4396 (personal-companion 1.43.0 AI label),
-- PR 4397 (qnfo-ipatent 3.19.0 Art. 50(1) disclosure); q08 method note https://q08.org/p/2026-10-26-how-q08-researches-writes-and-scores-its-forecasts-m3th0d.
-- APPLY-BY: ci
-- DB: qnfo-audit
-- Rollback: DROP TRIGGER IF EXISTS bp26_headline_heavy_tick; DELETE FROM analytics_metric_triggers WHERE notes LIKE 'BP26-CATALOGUE-1%'; DELETE FROM metric_registry WHERE source_of_truth LIKE '%[BP26]%'; DELETE FROM roadmap_implementation WHERE source = 'best-practice-2026'; DELETE FROM issue_project_map WHERE project_code LIKE 'BP26.%'; DELETE FROM human_actions WHERE slug LIKE 'bp26-%'; DELETE FROM goals WHERE goal_key = 'BP26-CATALOGUE'; DELETE FROM projects WHERE project_code LIKE 'BP26.%';
-- Rollback note: the agent_issues rows are not deleted on rollback (no silent drop, doctrine section 6); close them through issue_triage with evidence or supersede them.
-- spof-review: no new single point of failure; the headline refresh rides fleet_tick_heavy like pr_open_over_10m, and a missed tick delays the metric only.


