INSERT INTO agent_issues (title, description, source, category, priority, status, created_at, updated_at, predicate_id)
SELECT 'BP26-CLAIM-LEDGER-1: Claim-level provenance ledger with a dual-verifier gate for every published factual claim', 'Charter pillar: research. BP26 best-practice catalogue item 1.1, top-20 rank 6 (research report wf-232b4527-680f-8492-8dc9-5ab6ae365e14 (2026-10-26); owner directive 2026-10-26).
Project BP26.EDITORIAL under program QNFO.RSCH (program-manager:QNFO.RSCH).

PRACTICE: Split every published q08, reading.q08.org and papers.qnfo.org artifact and every social post into atomic claims stored in D1 (claim_id, artifact_id, text, source_url, source_quote, source_retrieved_at, archived_copy_r2_key, verifier_model, verdict, verified_at). Nothing is published while a claim lacks a supported verdict from a verifier independent of the author model; two verifiers from different families must agree; an unresolved claim is cut or hedged, never published. Archive each cited source to R2.

SOURCES: ICD 203 https://www.dni.gov/files/documents/ICD/ICD-203.pdf; IFCN Code of Principles https://ifcncodeofprinciples.poynter.org/; SPJ Code of Ethics https://www.spj.org/ethicscode.asp; Google Search Central generative-AI guidance https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/using-gen-ai-content

APPLIES TO: q08.org, reading.q08.org, papers.qnfo.org, qnfo-social, email agent outbound statements. Effort M.

STATE 2026-10-26: q08 research desk (scheduled task ''q08 daily research desk'', 2026-10-26) runs a claim-by-claim independent fact-check per piece; the claims are not yet stored per claim in D1. Coordinate with file:migrations/2026-10-26-research-provenance-ledger.sql (another session''s live claim) and extend it rather than build a second ledger.

METRICS (registered in metric_registry with triggers by migrations/2026-10-26-best-practice-catalogue.sql; each starts UNMEASURED and the producer that measures it is part of this issue):
- claim_coverage: verified atomic claims / all atomic claims in artifacts published in the last 7 days (claims ledger); target 100% (1.0).
- source_liveness: cited source URLs that resolve or have an archived R2 copy / all cited URLs (rolling 7 days); target >= 0.99.

DEFINITION OF DONE: the practice is live on every surface listed above, each metric above is measured by a worker or D1 producer on at least an hourly cadence, and every metric meets its target at two consecutive refreshes. The closing probe (remediation_contracts class issue-<id>) checks the metric values.', 'bp26-catalogue', 'optimization', 'high', 'open', CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000, CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000, 'BP26-CLAIM-LEDGER'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM agent_issues x WHERE x.predicate_id = 'BP26-CLAIM-LEDGER' AND x.status = 'open');

