INSERT INTO agent_issues (title, description, source, category, priority, status, created_at, updated_at, predicate_id)
SELECT 'BP26-RETENTION-1: Data minimisation and retention: TTL sweeps, payload logging off for mail, no raw emails in logs', 'Charter pillar: security. BP26 best-practice catalogue item 4.3, top-20 rank 14 (research report wf-232b4527-680f-8492-8dc9-5ab6ae365e14 (2026-10-26); owner directive 2026-10-26).
Project BP26.COMPLIANCE under program QNFO.OPS (program-manager:QNFO.OPS).

PRACTICE: Email agent stores message bodies at most 30 days (metadata and summaries longer only if needed), redacts third-party personal data before prompts where feasible, disables AI Gateway payload logging on mail calls (cf-aig-collect-log-payload: false); D1 TTL sweeps on cron and R2 lifecycle rules; the twin holds no special-category data; logs hash email addresses.

SOURCES: GDPR Art. 5(1)(c),(e) https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2016/679/oj; AI Gateway logging https://developers.cloudflare.com/ai-gateway/reference/pricing/

APPLIES TO: email agent, twin, newsletters, Workers Logs, AI Gateway logs. Effort S.

METRICS (registered in metric_registry with triggers by migrations/2026-10-26-best-practice-catalogue.sql; each starts UNMEASURED and the producer that measures it is part of this issue):
- records_past_retention: personal-data rows older than their table''s retention policy (retention_policy registry, to build); target 0.
- pii_in_logs: raw email addresses found by a regex scan of a daily sample of Workers Logs; target 0.

DEFINITION OF DONE: the practice is live on every surface listed above, each metric above is measured by a worker or D1 producer on at least an hourly cadence, and every metric meets its target at two consecutive refreshes. The closing probe (remediation_contracts class issue-<id>) checks the metric values.', 'bp26-catalogue', 'optimization', 'high', 'open', CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000, CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000, 'BP26-RETENTION'
