PRACTICE: The canonical deploy path runs wrangler versions upload, smoke-tests the version preview URL, then versions deploy at 10%, 50% and 100% with soak windows, compares error rate and p95 latency by version and calls wrangler rollback automatically on regression; migrations stay expand-then-contract; writes are idempotent because a code rollback does not undo data.

SOURCES: Gradual deployments https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/configuration/versions-and-deployments/gradual-deployments/; rollbacks https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/configuration/versions-and-deployments/rollbacks/; wrangler commands https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/wrangler/commands/workers/

