SELECT 'BP26-DURABLE-JOBS-1: Long jobs as Workflows, fan-out via Queues with idempotent consumers, strict limits and leases in Durable Objects', 'Charter pillar: core. BP26 best-practice catalogue item 2.6, top-20 rank 8 (research report wf-232b4527-680f-8492-8dc9-5ab6ae365e14 (2026-10-26); owner directive 2026-10-26).
