PRACTICE: Multi-step runs (fetch, extract claims, verify, publish, post) become Workflows with per-step retries and persisted state; fan-out through Queues with an idempotency key (UNIQUE in D1) per side effect because delivery is at least once; strict global rate limits and work-claim locks in Durable Objects (the Rate Limiting binding is per location and approximate).

SOURCES: Workers Best Practices https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/best-practices/workers-best-practices/; Rate Limiting binding https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/runtime-apis/bindings/rate-limit/

