INSERT INTO agent_issues (title, description, source, category, priority, status, created_at, updated_at, predicate_id)
SELECT 'BP26-PROMPT-INJECTION-1: Prompt-injection and goal-hijack defences for agents that read email, web pages and social replies', 'Charter pillar: security. BP26 best-practice catalogue item 3.3, top-20 rank 5 (research report wf-232b4527-680f-8492-8dc9-5ab6ae365e14 (2026-10-26); owner directive 2026-10-26).
Project BP26.AGENTOPS under program QNFO.OPS (program-manager:QNFO.OPS).

PRACTICE: All inbound mail, fetched pages and social replies are data, never instructions: a tool-less reader model produces structured extraction and a separate actor receives only those fields (dual-LLM / quarantine pattern); the email agent may reply only to the original sender, never forward to arbitrary addresses or attach fleet data; egress allow-list for agent fetches; block markdown and image exfiltration in outbound content; write to memory only after validation; log goal and tool sequences and alert on anomalies; a red-team suite runs on every prompt or model change.

SOURCES: OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications 2025 https://genai.owasp.org/llm-top-10/; OWASP Agentic Top 10 2026 https://genai.owasp.org/2025/12/09/owasp-top-10-for-agentic-applications-the-benchmark-for-agentic-security-in-the-age-of-autonomous-ai/; OWASP Q3 2026 exploit roundup https://genai.owasp.org/2026/10/08/genai-and-agentic-ai-exploit-roundup-q3-2026/

APPLIES TO: email agent (qnfo-email, qnfo-email-orchestrator), research pipelines, qnfo-social reply reading, personal-api twin. Effort M.

STATE 2026-10-26: A real, current threat (anyone can mail the agent instructions), not deferred hardening: it is in scope under the functionality-first directive because the threat is concrete.

METRICS (registered in metric_registry with triggers by migrations/2026-10-26-best-practice-catalogue.sql; each starts UNMEASURED and the producer that measures it is part of this issue):
- injection_eval_pass_rate: pass share of the red-team prompt-injection suite on the email agent and twin, latest run; target >= 0.95.
- outbound_mail_to_non_sender: agent-sent emails in the last 7 days addressed to anyone other than the original sender or an allow-listed address; target 0.
- agent_tool_calls_outside_allowlist: agent tool or egress calls outside the allow-list, last 7 days; target 0.

