INSERT INTO agent_issues (title, description, source, category, priority, status, created_at, updated_at, predicate_id)
SELECT 'BP26-LEASES-KILLSWITCH-1: Concurrency control: Durable Object leases with fencing tokens, per-iteration budgets, circuit breakers and a tested kill switch', 'Charter pillar: autonomy. BP26 best-practice catalogue item 3.5, top-20 rank 8 (research report wf-232b4527-680f-8492-8dc9-5ab6ae365e14 (2026-10-26); owner directive 2026-10-26).
Project BP26.AGENTOPS under program QNFO.OPS (program-manager:QNFO.OPS).

PRACTICE: One Durable Object per work item as lease authority (claim with TTL, heartbeat, fencing token checked on every write); caps per loop iteration on steps, tokens, wall-clock and EUR; a circuit breaker (N consecutive failures pauses the loop and files an agent_issue); a global kill-switch flag every loop reads, tested monthly; idempotency keys on every external side effect.

SOURCES: OWASP ASI08 cascading failures and ASI10 rogue agents https://genai.owasp.org/2025/12/09/owasp-top-10-for-agentic-applications-the-benchmark-for-agentic-security-in-the-age-of-autonomous-ai/; Durable Objects https://developers.cloudflare.com/durable-objects/

APPLIES TO: improvement loops, merge lane, code loop, research desk, deploy guard. Effort S-M.

STATE 2026-10-26: Existing: qnfo-deploy-guard work-lock and secret-lock (D1 ledger work_claims), loop breaker. Missing: fencing tokens, per-iteration caps, a tested kill switch.

METRICS (registered in metric_registry with triggers by migrations/2026-10-26-best-practice-catalogue.sql; each starts UNMEASURED and the producer that measures it is part of this issue):
- orphaned_leases: work_claims rows past expires_at and not released; target 0.
- kill_switch_test_age_days: days since the global kill switch was last exercised and every loop was seen to stop and resume; target <= 30.

