INSERT INTO agent_issues (title, description, source, category, priority, status, created_at, updated_at, predicate_id)
SELECT 'BP26-AUDIT-LOG-1: Append-only, hash-chained agent action log covering every publish, send, deploy, rollback and secret change', 'Charter pillar: security. BP26 best-practice catalogue item 3.6, top-20 rank 13 (research report wf-232b4527-680f-8492-8dc9-5ab6ae365e14 (2026-10-26); owner directive 2026-10-26).
Project BP26.AGENTOPS under program QNFO.OPS (program-manager:QNFO.OPS).

PRACTICE: An append-only agent_actions table in qnfo-audit (actor, session, tool, inputs hash, outputs hash, target, version_id, cost, timestamp) with no UPDATE or DELETE in code paths; a daily hash chain with the root written to R2; weekly FinOps digest per worker and loop; shard by month to respect the single-writer D1 limit.

SOURCES: NIST AI 600-1 https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework; OWASP Agentic Top 10 https://genai.owasp.org/2025/12/09/owasp-top-10-for-agentic-applications-the-benchmark-for-agentic-security-in-the-age-of-autonomous-ai/

APPLIES TO: fleet-wide. Effort S.

STATE 2026-10-26: Existing partial ledgers: decision_log, issue_lifecycle, code_tasks, deploy ledger, work_claims.

METRICS (registered in metric_registry with triggers by migrations/2026-10-26-best-practice-catalogue.sql; each starts UNMEASURED and the producer that measures it is part of this issue):
- audit_coverage: side-effecting actions (publishes, sends, deploys, rollbacks, secret writes) in the last 7 days with an agent_actions row / all such actions; target 1.0.
- audit_chain_verify: 1 when the latest daily hash-chain verification of agent_actions passed, else 0; target 1.

DEFINITION OF DONE: the practice is live on every surface listed above, each metric above is measured by a worker or D1 producer on at least an hourly cadence, and every metric meets its target at two consecutive refreshes. The closing probe (remediation_contracts class issue-<id>) checks the metric values.', 'bp26-catalogue', 'optimization', 'high', 'open', CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000, CAST(strftime('%s','now') AS INTEGER) * 1000, 'BP26-AUDIT-LOG'
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM agent_issues x WHERE x.predicate_id = 'BP26-AUDIT-LOG' AND x.status = 'open');

